      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce this fantastic three-bedroom mid terrace property to the market in the ever-popular location of Casement Drive in Finglas, Dublin 11.\n\nCasement Drive is ideally located within walking distance to Finglas Village which has a wide array of shops, bars and restaurants. IKEA, and DCU, Charlestown Shopping Centre, Clearwater Shopping Centre, Tolka Valley Park are other amenities and facilities close by to mention but a few. There are excellent bus routes and excellent road networks including the M50, M1 N2 and Port Tunnel are all within close proximity. No. 33 is also within an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools.\n\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 70 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, living room to front, kitchen and dining area all located downstairs. Upstairs hosts 3 generous bedrooms and a fully tiled bathroom with bath and shower.  To the rear, there is a large South facing rear garden. No. 33 is coming to the market in good condition throughout and benefits gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, front driveway and a generous south facing rear garden. The properties new owner will have the opportunity to lay down roots in one of Dublin 11s most sought after and family-oriented locations. An opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 70 sq.m</li>\n <li>BER E</li>\n <li>Mid Terrace</li>\n <li>3 Bed 1 Bath</li>\n <li>Large Rear garden</li>\n <li>South Facing Orientation</li>\n <li>Double Glazed windows</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Only 15 minutes' drive to Dublin Airport</li>\n <li>Within easy reach of M50 & N2 motorways</li>\n <li>Excellent primary and secondary schools in the area</li>\n <li>Bus routes to City Centre close by</li>\n <li>Within walking distance of Finglas Village</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike</li>\n <li>Early Viewing is highly advised!!</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 2"
      }
